text: ['({T}: Add {U}.)', 'Arc Lightning deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three targets.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\\nDauthi Slayer attacks each combat if able.', "When Man-o'-War enters the battlefield, return target creature to its owner's hand."]
flavor: ['"A wisp of life remains in the undergloom of Death: a visible form, though no heart beats within it."\\n—Homer, *The Iliad*, trans. Fitzgerald', '"Beauty to the eye does not always translate to the touch."\\n—Naimah, Femeref philosopher', '"If a man will begin with certainties, he shall end in doubts."\\n—Sir Francis Bacon,\\n*The Advancement of Learning*', '"It is vain to look for a defense against lightning."\\n—Publius Syrus, Maxim 835, trans. Lyman']
